{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_39","type":"agent_message","text":"The native scan produced substantial wins at several key regimes—about `0.092 ms` at `M=1`, `0.110 ms` at `M=64`, `0.171 ms` at `M=972`, `0.249 ms` at `M≈2K`, and `0.720 ms` at `M=8192`. I’m installing a conservative shape-bucketed AITER/rocBLAS dispatch now, retaining `torch.mm` where the scan did not beat the reference, and using verifier run 2 to validate integration across every workload."}}
